# Lines for the end of the Josh fight, said before the fade to the Victory or Defeat screen.
# player_won: the player beat Josh. player_lost: Josh beat the player.

~ player_won
Josh: You counted them. Nobody counts them.
Josh: Keep the deck, kid. Don't let it go to your head.
=> END

~ player_lost
Josh: House rules. The house shuffles.
Josh: Come back when you can tell a bomb from a bluff.
=> END
